msgid "Minimize Discord to System Tray"
msgstr "Minimizar Discord a la bandeja del sistema"

#: src\ui\settings.rs:1360
msgid "Clicking X minimizes Discord instead of closing it completely."
msgstr "Al hacer clic en X, se minimiza Discord en vez de cerrarlo por completo."

